YUKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>IMAIZUMI, YOSHINOBU</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KAO CORPORATION</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OHORI, KOICHI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TSUKAHARA, ITSURO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YAMASHITA, HIROYUKI</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>IMAIZUMI YOSHINOBU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OHORI KOICHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TSUKAHARA ITSURO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YAMASHITA HIROYUKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>IMAIZUMI, YOSHINOBU</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OHORI, KOICHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TSUKAHARA, ITSURO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YAMASHITA, HIROYUKI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>Enzyme particles from which an enzyme is quickly eluted without forming any insoluble matter, in which dusting is inhibited, and which scarcely causes classification of particles when used in detergent compositions; and a process for producing these enzyme particles. Namely, enzyme particles comprising: (A) a water insoluble substance and/or a hardly water soluble substance; (B) a water soluble binder; and (C) an enzyme, wherein the content of the component (A) is 45 % by weight or more, the average particle diameter thereof is from 150 to 50  mu m and the bulk density thereof is from 500 to 1000 g/L, and the major portion of the component (B) is located not inside but in the vicinity of the surface. An aggregate of enzyme particles which contain enzyme particles comprising: (A) a water insoluble substance and/or a hardly water soluble substance; (B) a water soluble binder; and (C) an enzyme, wherein the major portion of the component (B) is located not inside but in the vicinity of the surface.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>La présente invention concerne des particules d'enzyme à partir desquelles une enzyme est éluée sans formation d'une quelconque matière insoluble, dans lesquelles le poussiérage est bloqué, et qui ne provoquent guère de classification lorsqu'elles sont utilisées dans des compositions de détergents. L'invention concerne aussi un procédé de production de ces particules d'enzyme. Ces particules d'enzyme comprennent : (A) une substance insoluble dans l'eau et/ou une substance à solubilité aqueuse réduite, (B) un liant soluble dans l'eau, et (C) une enzyme, la teneur en composant (A) étant de 45 % en poids ou plus, le diamètre moyen des particules étant compris entre 150 et 50  mu m, et leur masse volumique apparente étant comprise entre 500 et 1000 g/l, la majeure partie du constituant (B) ne se trouvant pas à l'intérieur mais répartie à proximité de la surface. L'invention concerne aussi un agrégat de particules d'enzyme contenant des particules d'enzyme constituées (A) d'une substance insoluble dans l'eau et/ou une substance à solubilité aqueuse réduite, (B) d'un liant soluble dans l'eau, et (C) d'une enzyme, dans lesquelles la majeure partie du constituant (B) ne se trouve pas à l'intérieur mais répartie à proximité de la surface.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>